      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAKANUI (2) turned in a decent effort last start to finish third over 1100m at Julia Creek. Boasts two wins and a placing from just five spins around this circuit. Placed to advantage so anticipating another big run. POLLY HOFFA (8) ran below expectations last time at Julia Creek, finishing fifth and beaten 9 lengths starting at $2.40. Meets some better types this time but she has the ability to test this field. CLIODHNA MAEVE (5) finished 5 lengths away in fourth last time out over 800m at Corfield five days ago as $2.5 favourite. Has the gate speed to take up a forward position and rates a leading contender. HOWSE (4) settled well back when 13 lengths from the winner in 13th over 1800m at Mackay last start, a less impressive effort than his eighth at Barcaldine the run before. Has the ability to produce a better result.",
